SO-101 robot model (vendored)

  third_party/so101/ vendors the SO-101 robot model from TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100
  (https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100), the Simulation/SO101 subtree.

  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The exact upstream commit and file list are
  recorded in third_party/so101/VENDORED.md; the upstream license text is copied at
  third_party/so101/LICENSE.

  Brick Builder Arm Robot applies its own programmatic corrections on top of this model at load time (see
  brick_builder/robot/patch_so101.py); the vendored files themselves are not hand-edited.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

STS3215 servo constants (cited, not vendored)

  Brick Builder Arm Robot's servo model (brick_builder/robot/servo_model.py) uses numeric constants — the motor
  torque constant and resistance, backlash range, and joint damping/friction/armature values —
  that were measured and published by the Rhoban BAM project ("Better Actuator Models"):

    https://github.com/Rhoban/bam (Apache License, Version 2.0)
    Paper: arXiv:2410.08650

  No source code from that project is included in or copied into Brick Builder Arm Robot; only the
  published numeric constants are cited. See docs/guide/03-robot-and-servo-model.md for exactly
  which numbers are used and how.

